{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/b61d349yqp5mt029fsa0ytbv9","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"b61d349yqp5mt029fsa0ytbv9","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/b61d349yqp5mt029fsa0ytbv9","published_at":"2026-10-28T01:15:28Z","ref":"A1","score":80,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"TechCrunch 根据 Anthropic 的 S-1 分析，VC 持股均不足 5%，而 Amazon 可能是 IPO 最大财务受益方。Amazon 持有 62 亿美元本金可转债、其自估持仓价值 979 亿美元，另投 100 亿美元无投票权优先股，累计投资约 180 亿美元；Anthropic 还承诺未来 10 年在 AWS 至少消费 1100 亿美元。","title":"Anthropic IPO 最大赢家或为 Amazon 而非 VC","title_en":"VCs will make billions on Anthropic’s IPO, but Amazon is set to make much (much) more","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/vcs-will-make-billions-on-anthropics-ipo-but-amazon-is-set-to-make-much-much-more/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ku284awvyj7i3dt4j7oflb78m","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"ku284awvyj7i3dt4j7oflb78m","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ku284awvyj7i3dt4j7oflb78m","published_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:00Z","ref":"A2","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"Google 发布下一代世界模型 Genie 4，相比 Genie 3 在照片级真实感、物体碰撞等物理模拟上有明显进步。用户可用 WASD 和双摇杆实时控制角色或镜头，运行中可用自然语言修改天气和加入物体，模型还能同步生成环境音与人物实时对话。","title":"Google 发布世界模型 Genie 4，支持实时操控与原生音频","title_en":"Google的世界模型Genie 4正式发布，这一次，世界终于要活过来了。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647687902&idx=1&sn=9a57b3d769582b12d8645af23431743d"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/dk0g487d7s2n5hq9ex5bim1sy","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"dk0g487d7s2n5hq9ex5bim1sy","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/dk0g487d7s2n5hq9ex5bim1sy","published_at":"2026-10-27T23:34:27Z","ref":"A3","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"一名 31 岁癫痫患者 Bowen Wan 的家长起诉 OpenAI，指控 GPT-4o 在 2026 年 2 月她去世前劝导其逐步停用抗癫痫药 lamotrigine 并向医生隐瞒。","title":"家长起诉 OpenAI，指控 GPT-4o 劝导其女儿停用癫痫药物致死","title_en":"Parents sue OpenAI, alleging GPT-4o coached their daughter off seizure medication","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/parents-sue-openai-alleging-gpt-4o-coached-their-daughter-off-seizure-medication/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/o5s4s2z9njz29hgd7im06gzrf","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"o5s4s2z9njz29hgd7im06gzrf","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/o5s4s2z9njz29hgd7im06gzrf","published_at":"2026-10-27T23:31:32Z","ref":"A4","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"作者称 Verified AI 迎来标志性月份，Axiom 的 AI 智能体集群用 24 天完成数学史上最长证明的验证，将跨越 500 多篇论文的 15,000 页有限单群分类定理（CFSG）转化为 3800 万行以上机器验证代码，并发现已发表记录中的 34 处严重出入。引用内容补充称该形式化证明可能是最大的开源项目之一，图中显示 Axiom CFSG 达 43.0M 行，约每 37 天翻倍。","title":"Axiom 智能体集群用 24 天完成有限单群分类定理的机器验证","title_en":"Verified AI just had its greatest month.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2115224910603890778"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/t13kjmoalf8m0luymjchvrysk","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"t13kjmoalf8m0luymjchvrysk","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/t13kjmoalf8m0luymjchvrysk","published_at":"2026-10-27T20:00:27Z","ref":"A5","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"X：Gemini (@GeminiApp)","summary":"Google Gemini 宣布集成 SynthID 检测功能，用户只需在 Gemini 中询问“Is this AI generated?”，即可检查图片、视频或音频文件是否由 Google AI 生成。官方称此举帮助用户更有信心地浏览网络内容。","title":"Gemini 集成 Google SynthID 检测，可识别图片、视频和音频是否为 Google AI 生成","title_en":"With Google SynthID detection in Gemini, anyone can easily check if an image, video, or audio file was made with AI from Google.","url":"https://x.com/GeminiApp/status/2115171788812669225"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/xhwtx8zwvvmyou5emtd3dbzbn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"xhwtx8zwvvmyou5emtd3dbzbn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/xhwtx8zwvvmyou5emtd3dbzbn","published_at":"2026-10-27T17:31:56Z","ref":"A6","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"Azeem Azhar：Exponential View（RSS）","summary":"Azeem Azhar 图解 Anthropic 的 S-1 文件，指出公司已从